WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,920
In just one day, more than a thousand residents died in the community

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,520
More and more people are dying

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,280
Today's school banquet is stronger than yesterday

4
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:12,520
Many residents can’t even carry the secondary door, it’s quite heavy.

5
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:14,590
Let me see if I have a sword

6
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:18,990
Is there a sword inside?

7
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:20,390
It would be useless if there was no sword.

8
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,780
Bring fifteen in one hand

9
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,980
More than 90,000 swords means more than one million swords

10
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:28,090
This quantity cannot be used up at all

11
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:31,250
The price of long-range weapons is ridiculously high in the trading market

12
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:33,450
Must be hung up to exchange for gold coins and blueprints

13
00:00:38,610 --> 00:00:40,570
The effective range is about thirty meters

14
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:42,210
No matter how far the trajectory is, it will drift

15
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:44,530
But for people without fighting talent

16
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:46,450
Definitely a magical force

17
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:47,650
Hang up the trading platform

18
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:49,850
Just trade with gold coins and see how much you can sell.
